  "_comment": "Environmental relevance rules. The whole vocabulary lives here; the code contains no keyword. 'w' is the weight of a term and is multiplied by the weight of the field it appears in. An item is published when the total reaches 'min_score'. Terms are Spanish because the gazettes are, and topic labels are shown on the site.",
